#| "in the current package or as ``package.name``. Options: ``:members:``, "
#| "``:undoc-members:``, ``:private-members:`` (``@(private)`` "
#| "declarations, which are left out otherwise), ``:exclude-members:``, "
#| "``:member-order:`` (``source``, the default, by file name and then "
